// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002D0A23 size=275 name=?newObject@ThingFactory@@QAEPAVObject@@PBVThingTemplate@@PAVTeam@@PBUCreateMask@@W4ObjectID@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
Object *ThingFactory::newObject(const ThingTemplate *thingTemplate, Team *team, const CreateMask *mask, ObjectID id)
{
	if (thingTemplate == 0)
		return 0;

	if (isLoadingMap)
		Sleep(0);

	// pick one of the build variations at random
	const std::vector<AsciiString> &variations = thingTemplate->m_buildVariations;
	if (!variations.empty())
	{
		Int which = GetGameLogicRandomValue(0, variations.size() - 1, "C:\\projects\\bfme2patch103\\bfme2\\Code\\GameEngine\\Source\\Common\\Thing\\ThingFactory.cpp", 0x20B);
		const ThingTemplate *variation = findTemplate(variations[which]);
		if (variation != 0)
			thingTemplate = variation;
	}

	Object *obj = TheGameLogic->friend_createObject(thingTemplate, mask, team, id);

	for (BehaviorModule **module = obj->getBehaviorModules(); *module; ++module)
	{
		if (isLoadingMap)
			Sleep(0);
		CreateModuleInterface *create = (*module)->getCreate();
		if (create)
			create->onCreate();
	}

	if (isLoadingMap)
		Sleep(0);
	obj->initObject();
	if (isLoadingMap)
		Sleep(0);

	if (theLogicRandomLogFile)
		theLogicRandomLogFile->addLine("newObj %s id %i", thingTemplate->getName().str(), obj->getID());

	return obj;
}

